  "id": "65ac731e5d1db2becbe7c8b5",
  "name": "IMPERIUM \u2013 Multi-AI-Agent Command System",
  "slug": "imperium",
  "description": "Designed and developed a modular Multi-AI-Agent architecture for coordinating specialized AI agents. Built and completed the Job Agent as the first fully implemented agent for job discovery, resume generation, application workflows, and tracking. Developed Resume Studio to generate ATS-friendly resumes tailored to individual job descriptions. Designed REST APIs using Python and FastAPI for communication between frontend, backend, and agent modules. Built responsive interfaces using React and TypeScript. Integrated PostgreSQL and Supabase for structured application data. Implemented Selenium-based browser automation for repetitive application tasks. Additional AI agents can be added independently without restructuring the core system.",
  "clientName": "Independent Project",
  "completionDate": "2025-01-01T12:00:00.000Z",
